{"articleNo":"1391","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1391&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"■ 2010년도 2학기 교수, 학생예비군 보충훈련 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.09.14","hit":"11855","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">훈련통지서 수령장소 및 기간 : 2010. 9. 14~9. 30일(예비군연대 : G110호)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">2. 훈련장소 : 제 120보병연대 1대대훈련장(고아읍 송림리)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">3. 집결시간 : 훈련당일 08:50분까지 훈련장 도착</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">(개인별 출발)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">4. 훈련대상</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LI