 PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">인원</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">664</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">242</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"111\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">422</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"145\" height=\"40\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">홈페이지 명부 공지</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">5.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">개인별 훈련일자 및 편성분대는 학교 홈페이지 첨부물에서 확인할 것.</span><p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">※ 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">. 예비군복, 모자, 전투화, 군용혁띠, 고무줄 필히 착용할 것.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">나. 훈련장 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">집결시간엄수 : 08:50까지 훈련</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">장에 도착</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 개인증명 신분증 반드시 휴대(학생증, 주민등록증, 운전면허증)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">지연 도착자, 복장위반자, 신분증 미 휴대자는 불참조치 및 보충훈련실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 중식은 개인별 준비한다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">(식권은 총기 수령시 구매할 수 있슴 : 5,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">원)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\">단 군에서 지급되는 중식비(5,000원)와 교통비(4,000원)는 훈련 종료시&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 지급함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">※폰 번호 변경 또는 없는 학생은 반드시 수령증에 연락 가능한 번호 기록할 것</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">※전국단위훈련신청 : 학교 훈련기간 중에 훈련을 받을 수 없는 예비군은 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.yebigun1.mil.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">http://www.yebigun1.mil.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조,한컴돋움\">)에 들어가서 구미시 양포동 예비군중대로 전국단위훈련을 신청을 해서 2010. 10. 16(토)일 받을 수 있습니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
